#: ../troubleshoot/PrintTestPage.py:65
msgid ""
"Now print a test page.  If you are having problems printing a specific "
"document, print that document now and mark the print job below."
msgstr ""
"ດຽວນີ້ໃຫ້ພິມໜ້າທົດສອບ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີບັນຫາໃນການພິມເອກະສານໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ, ໃຫ້ພິມເອກະສານນັ້ນດຽວນີ້ ແລ້ວ"
"ໝາຍວຽກພິມໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້."

#: ../troubleshoot/PrintTestPage.py:77
msgid "Cancel All Jobs"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກວຽກທັງໝົດ"

#: ../troubleshoot/PrintTestPage.py:83
msgid "Test"
msgstr "ທົດສອບ"

#: ../troubleshoot/PrintTestPage.py:113
msgid "Did the marked print jobs print correctly?"
msgstr "ວຽກພິມທີ່ໝາຍໄວ້ພິມອອກມາຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່?"

#: ../troubleshoot/PrintTestPage.py:144
#, python-format
msgid "Remember to load paper of type '%s' into the printer first."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມໃສ່ເຈ້ຍປະເພດ '%s' ລົງໃນເຄື່ອງພິມກ່ອນ."

#: ../troubleshoot/PrintTestPage.py:430
msgid "Error submitting test page"
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການສົ່ງໜ້າທົດສອບ"

#: ../troubleshoot/QueueNotEnabled.py:58
#: ../troubleshoot/QueueRejectingJobs.py:68
#, python-format
msgid "The reason given is: '%s'."
msgstr "ເຫດຜົນທີ່ລະບຸຄື: '%s'."

#: ../troubleshoot/QueueNotEnabled.py:60
msgid "This may be due to the printer being disconnected or switched off."
msgstr "ນີ້ອາດເປັນຍ້ອນເຄື່ອງພິມບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ຖືກປິດຢູ່."

#: ../troubleshoot/QueueNotEnabled.py:64
msgid "Queue Not Enabled"
msgstr "ຄິວຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ"

#: ../troubleshoot/QueueNotEnabled.py:65
#, python-format
msgid "The queue '%s' is not enabled."
msgstr "ຄິວ '%s' ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: ../troubleshoot/QueueNotEnabled.py:73
msgid ""
"To enable it, select the 'Enabled' checkbox in the 'Policies' tab for the "
"printer in the printer administration tool."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງ 'ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ' ໃນແທັບ 'ນະໂຍບາຍ' ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງພິມນັ້ນໃນເຄື່ອງມືບໍລິຫານເຄື່ອ"
"ງພິມ."

#: ../troubleshoot/QueueRejectingJobs.py:33
msgid "Queue Rejecting Jobs"
msgstr "ຄິວກຳລັງປະຕິເສດວຽກ"

#: ../troubleshoot/QueueRejectingJobs.py:65
#, python-format
msgid "The queue '%s' is rejecting jobs."
msgstr "ຄິວ '%s' ກຳລັງປະຕິເສດວຽກ."

#: ../troubleshoot/QueueRejectingJobs.py:72
msgid ""
"To make the queue accept jobs, select the 'Accepting Jobs' checkbox in the "
"'Policies' tab for the printer in the printer administration tool."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄິວຍອມຮັບວຽກ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງ 'ຍອມຮັບວຽກ' ໃນແທັບ 'ນະໂຍບາຍ' ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງພິມນັ້ນໃນເຄື່ອງມືບໍລິຫາ"
"ນເຄື່ອງພິມ."

#: ../troubleshoot/RemoteAddress.py:28
msgid "Remote Address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ທາງໄກ"

#: ../troubleshoot/RemoteAddress.py:29
msgid ""
"Please enter as many details as you can about the network address of this "
"printer."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດໃຫ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເຮັດໄດ້ ກ່ຽວກັບທີ່ຢູ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຄື່ອງພິມນີ້."

#: ../troubleshoot/RemoteAddress.py:37
msgid "Server name:"
msgstr "ຊື່ເຊີເວີ:"

#: ../troubleshoot/RemoteAddress.py:44
msgid "Server IP address:"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີເວີ:"

#: ../troubleshoot/SchedulerNotRunning.py:28
msgid "CUPS Service Stopped"
msgstr "ການບໍລິການ CUPS ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ"

#: ../troubleshoot/SchedulerNotRunning.py:29
msgid ""
"The CUPS print spooler does not appear to be running.  To correct this, "
"choose System->Administration->Services from the main menu and look for the "
"'cups' service."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຕົວຈັດການຄິວການພິມ CUPS ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ລະບົບ->ການບໍລິຫານ->ການບໍລິກາ"
"ນ ຈາກເມນູຫຼັກ ແລ້ວຊອກຫາບໍລິການ 'cups'."

#: ../troubleshoot/ServerFirewalled.py:28
msgid "Check Server Firewall"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໄຟວໍຂອງເຊີເວີ"

#: ../troubleshoot/ServerFirewalled.py:29
msgid "It is not possible to connect to the server."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີໄດ້."

#: ../troubleshoot/ServerFirewalled.py:44
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Please check to see if a firewall or router configuration is blocking TCP "
"port %d on server '%s'."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາກວດສອບວ່າໄຟວໍ ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຣົາເຕີກຳລັງປິດກັ້ນພອດ TCP %d ເທິງເຊີເວີ '%s' ຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່."

#: ../troubleshoot/Shrug.py:28
msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "ຂໍອະໄພ!"

#: ../troubleshoot/Shrug.py:29
msgid ""
"There is no obvious solution to this problem.  Your answers have been "
"collected together with other useful information.  If you would like to "
"report a bug, please include this information."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີວິທີແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຊັດເຈນສຳລັບບັນຫານີ້. ຄຳຕອບຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ຖືກຮວບຮວມພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເປັນປະໂຫຍດອື່ນໆ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງ"
"ການລາຍງານບັກ, ກະລຸນາແນບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໄປນຳ."

#: ../troubleshoot/Shrug.py:36
